            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method (200) includes tracking (202) RFID tags (106) affixed to luggage items (108) within an aircraft cabin (104) to monitor distribution and/or movement of the luggage items within the aircraft cabin, collecting (210) RFID data from tracking the RFID tags for a plurality of flights, and optimizing boarding (212) and/or deboarding process(es) based on the RFID data.</p>
